{"change_summary":"Applied the one actionable follow-up from the latest review: updated `docs/ROUTING.md` so `CleanFilter` now matches the implemented budget-conserving behavior. The maintenance-routing table and the phase-1 lumping notes now describe filter cleaning as an in-tank reroute of removed decomposer/nitrifier biomass into dissolved organics (`DOC`/`DON`), not as a maintenance export.","outstanding_risks":["The structural canonical-helper coverage guard remains convention-based rather than reflective; future explicit N/C-bearing fields with non-standard names or fields hidden in empty-by-default collections will require extending the discovery rules and tests.","Shrimp eggs remain implicit until hatch; mass is conserved by debiting dissolved pools on hatch and maturation, but a future phase may still want an explicit egg or clutch biomass pool for clearer persistence and tracing.","Complex multi-process stages such as `system:nitrogen_cycle` still rely on snapshot-derived gross component budgets, so same-component turnover inside a single pass can remain collapsed until those stages emit fully explicit source/sink deltas."],"steps":[{"description":"Reviewed the latest validation output and identified the remaining documentation drift: `docs/ROUTING.md` still described `CleanFilter` as an export even though the implementation now reroutes removed microbial biomass into dissolved organics.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Updated `docs/ROUTING.md` so both the maintenance-routing table and the phase-1 lumping notes reflect the current `CleanFilter` semantics and no longer claim maintenance export behavior.","order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Inspected the resulting diff and confirmed no code-path changes were made, so no test rerun was necessary for this documentation-only fix.","order":3,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`git diff -- docs/ROUTING.md` shows the `CleanFilter { intensity }` row now routes removed decomposer/nitrifier biomass into dissolved organics with `Export routing` set to `none`.","`sed -n '140,166p' docs/ROUTING.md` confirms the corresponding phase-1 simplification note now says `CleanFilter` reroutes removed microbial biomass into dissolved organics instead of exporting it.","No code changed in this Apply Fixes stage, so prior validation remains authoritative: the latest review was `approved`, and the previously recorded `cargo test -p tank_core`, `cargo test -p tank_core --test budget_tracking`, `cargo test -p tank_core --test cycling`, and `cargo clippy -p tank_core -- -D warnings` results still apply."]}